  playerMovement: {fileID: 7732462034807385642}
  protagDialogue: {fileID: 1831259498}
  introLines:
  - Oh my gosh...
  - I knew you were a real person!!
  - I knew someone was helping me this whole time, I knew it!
  - Looks like you're using that robot body that was in the other room.
  - Very cool.
  - 'Okay. It looks like there are two doors here. '
  - Probably one for each of us.
  - Now that we're together, I know we can do this easy!
  - Let's go!
  endLines:
  - Having you with my makes everything so much better.
  - Come on, I bet we're almost at the end.
  instructions:
  - Click/hold E to interact with objects.
